# ── Bench artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# bench/results/ is ignored by default and every committed artifact is
# whitelisted below, one line each. Keep the groups together: the list used to
# run on past the "# IDE" section at the bottom of this file, which made it look
# finished three times over.
bench/.cache/
bench/results/*
!bench/results/.gitkeep

# SPECTER2 / synthetic harness — bench/run_baseline.py, crossover.py, run_rerank.py
!bench/results/BASELINE.md
!bench/results/CROSSOVER.md
!bench/results/crossover.csv
!bench/results/crossover.png
!bench/results/RERANK.md

# NOT YET GENERATED (re-checked 2026-08-03). These three are the output triple
# of bench/run_topn_sweep.py; the whitelist was added ahead of the run and the
# run has never been committed, so nothing in bench/results/ matches them today.
# Producing them needs the ONNX cross-encoder plus the SPECTER2 embedding cache.
# Kept rather than deleted so the artifacts land in git when someone does the
# run — but do not read these lines as evidence the files exist. Nothing else
# in the repo links to them; tests/test_docs_links.py enforces that.
!bench/results/RERANK_topn_sweep.md
!bench/results/rerank_topn_sweep.csv
!bench/results/rerank_topn_sweep.png

# Matryoshka sweeps + the sparse/BM25 negative result
!bench/results/SKETCH_MATRYOSHKA.md
!bench/results/SKETCH_MATRYOSHKA_GEMINI.md
!bench/results/BM25_SKETCH.md
!bench/results/BM25_FOLLOWUP.md
!bench/results/ROTATION_LSH.md

